"And challenge the POKéMON LEAGUE!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_1F/scripts.inc:158
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_1F_Text_EdgarIntro"
msgid ""
"I've made it this far a couple times,\n"
"but the last stretch is so long…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_1F/scripts.inc:162
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_1F_Text_EdgarDefeat"
msgid "My dream ends here again…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_1F/scripts.inc:165
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_1F_Text_EdgarPostBattle"
msgid ""
